{"title": "Bonesaw", "pageid": 13247, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bonesaw", "categories": ["Bugs", "Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "Longswords", "Common items", "Sources of Slashing damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\"> For the lightly enchanted variant see <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonesaw_(%2B1)\" title=\"Bonesaw (+1)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png/25px-Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png/38px-Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png/50px-Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png/25px-Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Bonesaw_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonesaw_(%2B1)\" title=\"Bonesaw (+1)\">Bonesaw (+1)</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bonesaw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Bonesaw_Icon.png/300px-Bonesaw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/7/70/Bonesaw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bonesaw image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Bonesaw_Icon.png/300px-Bonesaw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Bonesaw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF ;\">Bonesaw</span></strong> is a common variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Longswords\" title=\"Longswords\">Longswords</a> family of weapons. It is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">martial melee weapon</a> that can be wielded in one hand, or with both hands for extra damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The saw's teeth are blunt and rusted, it's beautiful metalwork barely visible beneath a layer of black, coagulated blood.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>One-handed damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d8 (1~8) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Two-handed damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">1d10 (1~10) + 